<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Join MODIT Supplier Network</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body class="app-page"><%- include('partials/header') %><main class="container"><section class="hero"><div><p class="section-kicker">SUPPLIER NETWORK / ONBOARDING</p><h1>Bring your materials to the sites that need them.</h1><p class="muted">Create your supplier profile in minutes. MODIT reviews your catalogue and service area before activating leads and quote requests.</p></div><div class="panel hero-card"><h3>What happens next</h3><div class="result-box">1. Profile review<br>2. GST & catalogue verification<br>3. Delivery-zone activation<br>4. Qualified RFQs in your dashboard</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="workflow-layout"><article class="card workflow-form"><div class="section-kicker">BUSINESS PROFILE</div><h2>Join the network</h2><form id="supplier-form"><label>Business name</label><input name="name" required placeholder="e.g. Sharma Buildmart"><div class="form-grid"><div><label>Primary city</label><select name="city"><option>Gurugram</option><option>Noida</option><option>Delhi</option><option>Faridabad</option><option>Ghaziabad</option></select></div><div><label>Typical dispatch time</label><select name="leadTime"><option>24 hrs</option><option>36 hrs</option><option>48 hrs</option><option>72 hrs</option></select></div></div><label>Contact number or email</label><input name="contact" required placeholder="name@company.com / +91"><label>Material categories</label><textarea name="categories" required rows="4" placeholder="Cement, TMT steel, aggregates"></textarea><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Submit supplier profile →</button></form></article><article class="card workflow-output"><div class="section-kicker">APPLICATION STATUS</div><div id="supplier-result" class="empty-state"><strong>Ready for your profile.</strong><p>Submitted businesses are persisted and become visible to the MODIT procurement engine.</p></div></article></div></section></main><script>const f=document.getElementById('supplier-form'),o=document.getElementById('supplier-result');f.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();o.innerHTML='<strong>Submitting profile…</strong>';const r=await fetch('/api/suppliers',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f)))});const d=await r.json();o.innerHTML=r.ok?`<div class="success-label">PROFILE SUBMITTED</div><h3>${d.supplier.name}</h3><p>${d.message}</p><div class="result-box">Status: <strong>${d.supplier.onboardingStatus}</strong><br>Service area: ${d.supplier.city}<br>Categories: ${d.supplier.focus}</div>`:`<p class="error">${d.error||'Could not submit profile.'}</p>`})</script></body></html>
